  "description": "In a world where gamers are the elite, Ryuhwi is an unknown, the lowest caste of society. Yet it hasn't always been this way... After years of working as a dedicated analyst for a top gaming guild, he was framed and saw his entire life fall apart. But one day, he's given a second chance by a mysterious (and kinda cute) machine claiming to be the system itself. With the odds now in his favor, he's determined to take revenge on all those who wronged him and uproot this corrupt society! \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
